Well I recently discovered something I have never seen 
mentioned here.  I am playing a priest who while not very
advanced yet has a great deal of potentail.  On level one is
an altar I immediately converted, on level two I found a wand
shop.

I plundered said shop as any good nethacker is wont to do,
and not content with just this bankrupted the shopkeeper.

On Level three low and behold another shop (general).  So
naturally...A plundering we will go, A plundering...

Spoilers follow

So I nuke holes in the walls of the shop with my recently
plundered wand of digging.  The holes are diagonally
across one corner as it is a big shop and kicking out the
door is just to far.  So I'm stealing away and I accidentily
forget to drop one lousy tripe ration! I step out and....

You escaped the shop without paying etc etc....

Not being anywhere near the door I step back in the shop
and Asidinhopo warns me she is pissed about some missing
merchandise.  I managed to kill off all the Kops in the
shop and then dropped some stolen merchandise.  She accepts the
first and then starts paying me for the rest.  I walked over to her
and she didn't hit me.  I walked out of the shop and all the
Kops were gone!  If you pay her back all the Kops dissappear
and she is happy again!

